WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.086
Welcome to Module 10: Agentic AI Governance.

2
00:00:04.086 --> 00:00:08.080
When AI systems can act, mistakes become actions.

3
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:20.520
You will learn why agents need governance, describe nine areas of agent governance, and apply practical controls: guardrails, human approval, evaluation, and monitoring.

4
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:31.465
You will explore safety, transparency, privacy, oversight, access control, evaluation, accountability, monitoring, and responsible deployment.

5
00:00:31.465 --> 00:00:39.060
You will follow a request through layered controls, run three Python labs, and learn how to respond to incidents.

6
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.637
The key takeaway: no single control is enough.

7
00:00:43.637 --> 00:00:47.920
Layer guardrails, permissions, human approval, and monitoring.
